"""Per-finding knowledge base.

Each rule_id maps to structured, analyst-grade detail used to build the
drill-down view. This content is deterministic and authored; the optional AI
layer (ai.py) adds tenant-contextual narration on top of it, never replacing it.

Fields:
  summary           one-line plain statement of the issue
  why               why it matters (risk explanation)
  scenario          concrete attacker steps to abuse it
  impact            business impact if exploited
  steps             ordered remediation actions
  detection         how to detect/monitor for abuse (e.g. KQL/audit hint)
"""
